| `grepRaw(pattern, path, glob)`  | `grep(pattern, path, glob)`  |  `GrepMatch[] | string` → `GrepResult`  |  
| `globInfo(pattern, path)`  | `glob(pattern, path)`  |  `FileInfo[]` → `GlobResult`  |  
| `write(...)`  | `write(...)`  | Unchanged (`WriteResult`)  |  
| `edit(...)`  | `edit(...)`  | Unchanged (`EditResult`)  |  
