## 
[​](https://docs.langchain.com/oss/javascript/deepagents/frontend/sandbox#architecture)
Architecture
The sandbox pattern has three layers:
  1. **Deep agent with sandbox backend:** The agent gets filesystem tools (`read_file`, `write_file`, `edit_file`, `execute`) automatically from the sandbox
  2. **Custom API server:** A Hono app exposed via `langgraph.json`’s `http.app` field, providing file browsing endpoints the frontend can call
  3. **IDE frontend:** A three-panel layout (file tree, code/diff viewer, chat) that syncs files in real time as the agent makes changes


